{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:docs/prototype/package-lock.json",
    "title": "设计原型依赖锁定",
    "summary": "该锁文件固定了 omem 设计原型的 React 运行依赖与 esbuild、Playwright 测试工具版本，并记录平台相关可选包、下载源及完整性信息。它能说明依赖解析结果，但不能单独证明构建或浏览器测试已经实际执行成功。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "dependency-baseline",
        "title": "依赖基线",
        "body": "锁文件采用 lockfileVersion 3，并在根包中固定 React、React DOM、Playwright Test 与 esbuild 的精确版本，形成可重复安装的依赖解析基线。[[c1]] 这些是配置事实，与 package.json 的直接声明相对应，但不能据此推断原型已具备某项产品功能。"
      },
      {
        "key": "toolchain-and-runtime",
        "title": "工具链与运行约束",
        "body": "Playwright Test 被锁定为 1.58.2，依赖同版本 Playwright，并声明 Node.js 至少为 18；这说明浏览器自动化工具链的安装约束，不代表已有测试覆盖或通过记录。[[c2]] esbuild 同样要求 Node.js 至少为 18，并将 AIX、Android、macOS、Linux、BSD、Windows 等操作系统及多种 CPU 架构的二进制包列为可选依赖，以便安装时选择匹配平台。[[c3]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "registry-and-limits",
        "title": "来源与证据边界",
        "body": "锁定包的解析地址指向 `bnpm.byted.org`，说明该依赖快照绑定了特定镜像来源；迁移到外部、离线或受限网络环境时，需要确认该地址是否可达。[[c4]] 锁文件还提供完整性摘要，但没有命令退出码、行为断言或构建产物信息，因此不能声称构建、冒烟测试或浏览器测试已经通过。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "根依赖锁定清单",
        "reason": "支持锁文件格式以及 React、React DOM、Playwright Test 和 esbuild 四项直接依赖均固定到精确版本的论断。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:docs/prototype/package-lock.json",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 15
        },
        "quote": "{\n  \"name\": \"omem-design-prototype\",\n  \"lockfileVersion\": 3,\n  \"requires\": true,\n  \"packages\": {\n    \"\": {\n      \"name\": \"omem-design-prototype\",\n      \"dependencies\": {\n        \"react\": \"18.3.1\",\n        \"react-dom\": \"18.3.1\"\n      },\n      \"devDependencies\": {\n        \"@playwright/test\": \"1.58.2\",\n        \"esbuild\": \"0.28.1\"\n      }"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "Playwright 测试工具约束",
        "reason": "支持 Playwright Test 的锁定版本、同版本 Playwright 依赖以及 Node.js 最低版本要求，同时界定其只是安装配置。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:docs/prototype/package-lock.json",
          "startLine": 459,
          "endLine": 473
        },
        "quote": "    \"node_modules/@playwright/test\": {\n      \"version\": \"1.58.2\",\n      \"resolved\": \"https://bnpm.byted.org/@playwright/test/-/test-1.58.2.tgz\",\n      \"integrity\": \"sha512-akea+6bHYBBfA9uQqSYmlJXn61cTa+jbO87xVLCWbTqbWadRVmhxlXATaOjOgcBaWU4ePo0wB41KMFv3o35IXA==\",\n      \"dev\": true,\n      \"license\": \"Apache-2.0\",\n      \"dependencies\": {\n        \"playwright\": \"1.58.2\"\n      },\n      \"bin\": {\n        \"playwright\": \"cli.js\"\n      },\n      \"engines\": {\n        \"node\": \">=18\"\n      }"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "esbuild 多平台可选依赖",
        "reason": "完整列出 esbuild 的 Node.js 约束及各操作系统、CPU 架构对应的可选包，支持其按目标平台选择二进制依赖的说明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:docs/prototype/package-lock.json",
          "startLine": 475,
          "endLine": 515
        },
        "quote": "    \"node_modules/esbuild\": {\n      \"version\": \"0.28.1\",\n      \"resolved\": \"https://bnpm.byted.org/esbuild/-/esbuild-0.28.1.tgz\",\n      \"integrity\": \"sha512-HrJrvZv5ayxBzPfwphOoNzkzOIIlifzk0KJrGK2c8R4+LKpMtpYLQeUdjnwjWv/LZlkH2laZk+4w78pi99D4Vw==\",\n      \"dev\": true,\n      \"hasInstallScript\": true,\n      \"license\": \"MIT\",\n      \"bin\": {\n        \"esbuild\": \"bin/esbuild\"\n      },\n      \"engines\": {\n        \"node\": \">=18\"\n      },\n      \"optionalDependencies\": {\n        \"@esbuild/aix-ppc64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/android-arm\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/android-arm64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/android-x64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/darwin-arm64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/darwin-x64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/freebsd-arm64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/freebsd-x64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/linux-arm\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/linux-arm64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/linux-ia32\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/linux-loong64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/linux-mips64el\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/linux-ppc64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/linux-riscv64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/linux-s390x\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/linux-x64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/netbsd-arm64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/netbsd-x64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/openbsd-arm64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/openbsd-x64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/openharmony-arm64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/sunos-x64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/win32-arm64\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/win32-ia32\": \"0.28.1\",\n        \"@esbuild/win32-x64\": \"0.28.1\"\n      }"
      },
      {
